        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Blog Post to Social Thread\n\nTurns a long article into a numbered social thread of six to eight posts. Each post must read on its own, which stops the result from being a summary cut into pieces.\n\n**How it works:** Paste the article into \"1 Input\". \"2 Agent\" writes posts under 280 characters each, with no hashtags. \"3 Output\" shows the thread as text.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on the Agent and change the limit in its system prompt to 500 characters for a platform that allows longer posts."
